    - target: {fileID: 2758647863444609526, guid: bb861667440b48e409041eae842d0d2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "For ages, humanity has marched in straight lines \u2014 uniform, rigid,
        obedient. But the kangaroo follows no formation. It leaps. It adapts. It
        lives untethered to the cold machinery of militaristic control. Here, we
        follow the ancient marsupial wisdom: strength not in destruction, but in
        balance and boundless motion.\nYou have felt it \u2014 the quiet discomfort
        when surrounded by rules, uniforms, and ranks. You are not alone. The pouch
        calls."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
