  m_text: "Before written time, the First Roo observed the armies of humans clash
    over land and pride. The kangaroo did not participate \u2014 it fled, watched,
    and survived. Its survival was not weakness, but enlightenment. The Order was
    formed to honor this resilience: to reject destruction and embrace motion, instinct,
    and freedom."
